WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.152 line:88% align:center
Finally, let's show the roadmap to other people.

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:04.940 line:88% align:center
There are two ways to present it.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.992 line:88% align:center
The first is to steer with the pointer.

4
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.749 line:88% align:center
Select the target on the toolbar, then move towards an edge,

5
00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:14.815 line:88% align:center
and the timeline glides that way.

6
00:00:14.865 --> 00:00:16.318 line:88% align:center
In the middle, it rests.

7
00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:19.228 line:88% align:center
The second is to prepare slides.

8
00:00:19.278 --> 00:00:21.233 line:88% align:center
In Edit, open the Slides tab.

9
00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:24.274 line:88% align:center
Set the roadmap up the way you want it seen,

10
00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.384 line:88% align:center
then save that view as a slide, with a title.

11
00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:30.972 line:88% align:center
Back in View, select the screen on the toolbar.

12
00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:34.107 line:88% align:center
The roadmap glides from one saved view to the next.

13
00:00:34.157 --> 00:00:37.733 line:88% align:center
The right arrow goes forward, and the left arrow goes back.

14
00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:44.442 line:88% align:center
A thin bar across the very top fills as you go,

15
00:00:44.492 --> 00:00:47.368 line:88% align:center
so everyone can see how far through you are.

16
00:00:47.418 --> 00:00:49.296 line:88% align:center
Escape ends the presentation.

17
00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:52.655 line:88% align:center
Afterwards, export the slides as a PDF.

18
00:00:52.705 --> 00:00:54.847 line:88% align:center
You get one page for each slide,

19
00:00:54.897 --> 00:00:57.177 line:88% align:center
with its description as a caption.

20
00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.227 line:88% align:center
That is Roadmap Builder.

21
00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:00.947 line:88% align:center
Plan it, see it, and share it.

